#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE1155 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "The study inventory holds only DM; the Procedure Agents (AG) dataset is absent -> AG dataset should be included in every Animal Rule study submission -> the Domain Presence Check fires."
#library standard=sendig-ar version=1-0
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID  type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col SETCD   type=Char label="Set Code"
---
STUDY01 | DM | STUDY01-001 | 001 | SET1
